{
  "episode": "ep09",
  "title": "明治維新と文明開化",
  "gaps": {
    "beat": 0.3,
    "scene": 0.6,
    "section": 0.8,
    "tail": 0.6
  },
  "total_duration": 599.581,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "section": "opening",
      "start": 0.0,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s01_b00.wav",
          "start": 0.0,
          "duration": 4.192,
          "text": "ねえ先生、侍がいなくなったら、日本はどうなるの？"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s01_b01.wav",
          "start": 4.492,
          "duration": 5.717,
          "text": "実は、ここから新しい日本が始まるんです!大改革の理由を、順番に見ていきましょう。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s01_b02.wav",
          "start": 10.509,
          "duration": 2.709,
          "text": "よし、明治、スタートなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 14.019,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b00.wav",
          "start": 14.019,
          "duration": 2.976,
          "text": "大政奉還の後、すぐ平和なのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b01.wav",
          "start": 17.295,
          "duration": 3.563,
          "text": "なぜなら、新旧勢力の対立が深まっていました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b02.wav",
          "start": 21.157,
          "duration": 4.363,
          "text": "その結果、鳥羽伏見の戦いと戊辰戦争が起きました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b03.wav",
          "start": 25.82,
          "duration": 1.877,
          "text": "辰の年の戦いなのだ…?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b04.wav",
          "start": 27.997,
          "duration": 7.093,
          "text": "ええ、ただ江戸は西郷と勝海舟の交渉で開城し、流血を避けました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b05.wav",
          "start": 35.391,
          "duration": 4.373,
          "text": "1869年、箱館の戦いで終結します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b06.wav",
          "start": 40.064,
          "duration": 1.909,
          "text": "話し合いで江戸を救ったのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 42.573,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b00.wav",
          "start": 42.573,
          "duration": 2.677,
          "text": "新しい政府は、なにを目指すのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b01.wav",
          "start": 45.551,
          "duration": 4.853,
          "text": "1868年、五箇条の御誓文で方針を示します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b02.wav",
          "start": 50.704,
          "duration": 5.227,
          "text": "「広く会議を興し」、みんなで話し合う国づくりの宣言です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b03.wav",
          "start": 56.231,
          "duration": 1.952,
          "text": "話し合い、大事なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b04.wav",
          "start": 58.483,
          "duration": 2.741,
          "text": "中心の体制は太政官制です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b05.wav",
          "start": 61.524,
          "duration": 4.885,
          "text": "太政大臣を頂点に、役所が分かれて日本を動かします。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b06.wav",
          "start": 66.709,
          "duration": 2.645,
          "text": "新しい国のエンジンが、始動なのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 69.955,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b00.wav",
          "start": 69.955,
          "duration": 1.845,
          "text": "藩は、どうなったのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b01.wav",
          "start": 72.1,
          "duration": 5.611,
          "text": "1869年に版籍奉還、1871年に廃藩置県。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b02.wav",
          "start": 78.011,
          "duration": 6.24,
          "text": "藩をやめて県を置き、全国を中央の一元管理にしました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b03.wav",
          "start": 84.551,
          "duration": 2.432,
          "text": "藩のボスたちが、いなくなるのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b04.wav",
          "start": 87.283,
          "duration": 6.581,
          "text": "ええ、大名の力をなくして、力の集中した新しい国が生まれます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b05.wav",
          "start": 94.164,
          "duration": 3.723,
          "text": "江戸幕府の仕組みは、ここで完全に終わりです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b06.wav",
          "start": 98.187,
          "duration": 4.576,
          "text": "府県の数も整理して、管理しやすい形にしました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b07.wav",
          "start": 103.063,
          "duration": 2.368,
          "text": "中央集権、完成なのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 106.031,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b00.wav",
          "start": 106.031,
          "duration": 2.528,
          "text": "江戸の身分制度は、どうなったのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b01.wav",
          "start": 108.859,
          "duration": 3.157,
          "text": "身分の上下をやめて、四民平等です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b02.wav",
          "start": 112.316,
          "duration": 6.229,
          "text": "華族・士族・平民に整理し、職業も自由に選べます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b03.wav",
          "start": 118.845,
          "duration": 2.635,
          "text": "生まれで決めない、新しいルールなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b04.wav",
          "start": 121.78,
          "duration": 4.992,
          "text": "ええ、ただ武士には給与が減り、不満もたまりました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b05.wav",
          "start": 127.072,
          "duration": 3.872,
          "text": "この不満が、後の士族反乱につながります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b06.wav",
          "start": 131.244,
          "duration": 3.285,
          "text": "江戸は身分で制限、明治は能力なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b07.wav",
          "start": 134.829,
          "duration": 1.771,
          "text": "ナイス比較、そのとおりです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b08.wav",
          "start": 136.9,
          "duration": 4.448,
          "text": "ただ、能力で働ける社会の、第一歩でもありました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b09.wav",
          "start": 141.648,
          "duration": 2.229,
          "text": "変わると、誰かがつらいのだ…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 144.477,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b00.wav",
          "start": 144.477,
          "duration": 2.016,
          "text": "学校は、どうなったのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b01.wav",
          "start": 146.793,
          "duration": 4.309,
          "text": "1872年の学制で、義務教育が始まります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b02.wav",
          "start": 151.403,
          "duration": 5.344,
          "text": "身分に関係なく、子どもはみんな小学校へ通うルールです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b03.wav",
          "start": 157.047,
          "duration": 1.739,
          "text": "学校は武士だけなのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b04.wav",
          "start": 159.085,
          "duration": 4.448,
          "text": "いいえ、身分に関係なくみんな通うんです。読み書きは国の投資です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b05.wav",
          "start": 163.833,
          "duration": 1.312,
          "text": "国の投資なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b06.wav",
          "start": 165.445,
          "duration": 5.92,
          "text": "ええ、知識を持つ国民で国を強くする、大事な一歩でした。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b07.wav",
          "start": 171.665,
          "duration": 4.256,
          "text": "費用負担で不満もありましたが、教育は広がります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b08.wav",
          "start": 176.221,
          "duration": 3.883,
          "text": "机とともに、近代がやってきたんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b09.wav",
          "start": 180.404,
          "duration": 2.155,
          "text": "日本じゅう、学校なのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 183.159,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b00.wav",
          "start": 183.159,
          "duration": 1.856,
          "text": "軍は、どうなったのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b01.wav",
          "start": 185.315,
          "duration": 3.189,
          "text": "1873年、徴兵令が出ます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b02.wav",
          "start": 188.804,
          "duration": 6.592,
          "text": "身分に関係なく満20歳の男子が兵役につく、国民皆兵です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b03.wav",
          "start": 195.696,
          "duration": 2.432,
          "text": "武士だけじゃない、みんなの軍なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b04.wav",
          "start": 198.428,
          "duration": 4.832,
          "text": "ええ、侍と刀に頼らない、新しい軍隊です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b05.wav",
          "start": 203.56,
          "duration": 3.52,
          "text": "現代的な国の形が、そろっていきます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b06.wav",
          "start": 207.38,
          "duration": 3.808,
          "text": "西洋の軍隊のしくみを、まねして作りました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b07.wav",
          "start": 211.488,
          "duration": 2.72,
          "text": "国の形、どんどん新しくなるのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 214.808,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b00.wav",
          "start": 214.808,
          "duration": 2.144,
          "text": "税の仕組みも、変わるのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b01.wav",
          "start": 217.252,
          "duration": 4.139,
          "text": "1873年の地租改正で、土地の価値の3%を、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b02.wav",
          "start": 221.691,
          "duration": 8.16,
          "text": "現金で納めるルールにします。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b03.wav",
          "start": 230.151,
          "duration": 2.944,
          "text": "米の値段に左右されない、安定した財源です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b04.wav",
          "start": 233.395,
          "duration": 2.645,
          "text": "現金で納税、近代的なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b05.wav",
          "start": 236.34,
          "duration": 5.515,
          "text": "ええ、ただ負担が重く、農民の一揆が各地で起きました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b06.wav",
          "start": 242.155,
          "duration": 4.171,
          "text": "新しい制度は、痛みを伴うものでもありました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b07.wav",
          "start": 246.625,
          "duration": 4.469,
          "text": "大地主や農家の生活も、大きく変わっていきます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b08.wav",
          "start": 251.395,
          "duration": 2.272,
          "text": "変革の影に、がまんなのだ…"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 254.267,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b00.wav",
          "start": 254.267,
          "duration": 2.293,
          "text": "お金の仕組みは、どうするのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b01.wav",
          "start": 256.86,
          "duration": 1.216,
          "text": "殖産興業です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b02.wav",
          "start": 258.376,
          "duration": 5.579,
          "text": "政府が官営の工場を建てて、近代産業の手本を示しました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b03.wav",
          "start": 264.255,
          "duration": 2.773,
          "text": "国が、お手本の工場を作るのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b04.wav",
          "start": 267.328,
          "duration": 3.456,
          "text": "ええ、1872年の富岡製糸場は、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b05.wav",
          "start": 271.084,
          "duration": 8.587,
          "text": "洋式の機械で糸を作る、有名なモデル工場です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b06.wav",
          "start": 279.971,
          "duration": 2.133,
          "text": "その後、民間に払い下げられます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b07.wav",
          "start": 282.404,
          "duration": 4.725,
          "text": "近代産業の種が、ここから日本じゅうに広がっていきます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b08.wav",
          "start": 287.429,
          "duration": 2.336,
          "text": "富岡製糸場、おぼえたのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 290.365,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b00.wav",
          "start": 290.365,
          "duration": 2.08,
          "text": "くらしは、どう変わったのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b01.wav",
          "start": 292.745,
          "duration": 1.045,
          "text": "文明開化です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b02.wav",
          "start": 294.091,
          "duration": 1.045,
          "text": "洋服や洋食、ガス灯や鉄道、新聞や雑誌まで広がり、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b03.wav",
          "start": 295.436,
          "duration": 1.472,
          "text": "暮らしがぐっと変わりました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b04.wav",
          "start": 297.208,
          "duration": 1.653,
          "text": "鉄道と牛鍋なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b05.wav",
          "start": 299.161,
          "duration": 6.944,
          "text": "ええ、1883年に開いた鹿鳴館では、洋装の舞踏会が開かれました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b06.wav",
          "start": 306.405,
          "duration": 3.872,
          "text": "西洋に日本を合わせようとしたんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b07.wav",
          "start": 310.577,
          "duration": 5.312,
          "text": "散切り頭と牛鍋、そして鹿鳴館のダンス…文明開化セットなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 316.489,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b00.wav",
          "start": 316.489,
          "duration": 2.091,
          "text": "政治は、どうなってたのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b01.wav",
          "start": 318.88,
          "duration": 6.923,
          "text": "1874年、板垣退助らが「民選議院設立建白書」を提出します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b02.wav",
          "start": 326.103,
          "duration": 5.653,
          "text": "国民が選ぶ議会をつくって、と求める運動の始まりです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b03.wav",
          "start": 332.056,
          "duration": 2.357,
          "text": "民の声を、政治にのせるのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b04.wav",
          "start": 334.713,
          "duration": 4.267,
          "text": "ええ、これはのちの自由民権運動につながります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b05.wav",
          "start": 339.28,
          "duration": 2.304,
          "text": "次回のいちばんのテーマです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b06.wav",
          "start": 341.884,
          "duration": 6.219,
          "text": "不満を持つ武士と、議会を求める民。二つの流れに注目です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b07.wav",
          "start": 348.403,
          "duration": 1.899,
          "text": "つづきが、楽しみなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 350.901,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b00.wav",
          "start": 350.901,
          "duration": 2.688,
          "text": "政府の中でも、もめ事があるのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b01.wav",
          "start": 353.889,
          "duration": 1.536,
          "text": "1873年、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b02.wav",
          "start": 355.725,
          "duration": 7.371,
          "text": "西郷隆盛らが朝鮮を武力で開こうとする征韓論を主張します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b03.wav",
          "start": 363.396,
          "duration": 3.317,
          "text": "帰国した岩倉らは国内を優先と、反対しました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b04.wav",
          "start": 367.013,
          "duration": 1.963,
          "text": "政府が、われちゃうのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b05.wav",
          "start": 369.276,
          "duration": 4.992,
          "text": "ええ、西郷や板垣、後藤象二郎らが政府を去ります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b06.wav",
          "start": 374.568,
          "duration": 6.165,
          "text": "この分裂が、士族の反乱と民権運動の、二つの流れを生みます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b07.wav",
          "start": 381.033,
          "duration": 2.581,
          "text": "わかれ道が、二本に枝分かれなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 384.215,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b00.wav",
          "start": 384.215,
          "duration": 2.283,
          "text": "武士のみなさんは、どうしたのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b01.wav",
          "start": 386.797,
          "duration": 2.421,
          "text": "徴兵と廃藩で武士の役割がなくなり、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b02.wav",
          "start": 389.519,
          "duration": 6.933,
          "text": "給与も減って、不満がたまりました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b03.wav",
          "start": 396.752,
          "duration": 2.112,
          "text": "士族反乱の芽、ここから伸びます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b04.wav",
          "start": 399.164,
          "duration": 1.952,
          "text": "侍たち、つらいのだ…"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b05.wav",
          "start": 401.416,
          "duration": 6.485,
          "text": "ええ、そしてこの不満と民権の声が、次の時代の二本柱です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b06.wav",
          "start": 408.201,
          "duration": 2.059,
          "text": "まずは、ポイントまとめへ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b07.wav",
          "start": 410.56,
          "duration": 3.669,
          "text": "それでも日本は、前へ進み続けました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b08.wav",
          "start": 414.529,
          "duration": 1.771,
          "text": "まとめ、お願いなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 416.9,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b00.wav",
          "start": 416.9,
          "duration": 1.547,
          "text": "西南戦争は何年?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b01.wav",
          "start": 418.747,
          "duration": 2.603,
          "text": "1877年、なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b02.wav",
          "start": 421.649,
          "duration": 0.725,
          "text": "そのとおり!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b03.wav",
          "start": 422.675,
          "duration": 6.325,
          "text": "1877年、西郷隆盛を中心に士族が起こした西南戦争です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b04.wav",
          "start": 429.3,
          "duration": 5.248,
          "text": "新政府軍が勝ち、武士の時代はここで完全に終わりました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b05.wav",
          "start": 434.848,
          "duration": 1.344,
          "text": "最後の武士なのだ…"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b06.wav",
          "start": 436.492,
          "duration": 6.219,
          "text": "また1879年、琉球処分が行われました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b07.wav",
          "start": 443.011,
          "duration": 3.083,
          "text": "琉球の人々の歩みも学びます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b08.wav",
          "start": 446.393,
          "duration": 2.677,
          "text": "それぞれの歴史を、学び続けるのだ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "section": "points",
      "start": 449.871,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b00.wav",
          "start": 449.871,
          "duration": 3.573,
          "text": "ここから受験ポイントのまとめ!まずは、新政府の改革。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b01.wav",
          "start": 453.744,
          "duration": 7.211,
          "text": "戊辰戦争1868年〜69年、五箇条の御誓文と太政官制、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b02.wav",
          "start": 461.255,
          "duration": 6.528,
          "text": "版籍奉還1869年、廃藩置県1871年、四民平等。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b03.wav",
          "start": 468.083,
          "duration": 2.027,
          "text": "中央集権の完成です!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b04.wav",
          "start": 470.409,
          "duration": 5.739,
          "text": "「1868・1869・1871」の流れで覚えましょう。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "section": "points",
      "start": 476.748,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b00.wav",
          "start": 476.748,
          "duration": 2.955,
          "text": "後半は、国民づくりと産業・文化です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b01.wav",
          "start": 480.003,
          "duration": 4.085,
          "text": "学制1872年、徴兵令1873年、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b02.wav",
          "start": 484.388,
          "duration": 2.187,
          "text": "地租改正1873年で国民の三本柱。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b03.wav",
          "start": 486.875,
          "duration": 7.296,
          "text": "殖産興業=富岡製糸場、文明開化=鹿鳴館、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b04.wav",
          "start": 494.471,
          "duration": 3.147,
          "text": "そして1874年板垣退助の建白書!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b05.wav",
          "start": 497.917,
          "duration": 5.333,
          "text": "「三本柱+産業+文化」で、明治の国づくり完璧です!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 504.051,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b00.wav",
          "start": 504.051,
          "duration": 2.091,
          "text": "それではクイズタイム!第一問!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b01.wav",
          "start": 506.441,
          "duration": 10.155,
          "text": "1871年、藩をやめて県を置いた改革は何でしょう?ア、廃藩置県。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b02.wav",
          "start": 516.896,
          "duration": 1.845,
          "text": "イ、版籍奉還。ウ、太閤検地。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b03.wav",
          "start": 519.041,
          "duration": 1.867,
          "text": "藩がなくなる…アなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b04.wav",
          "start": 521.208,
          "duration": 5.696,
          "text": "正解!廃藩置県です。版籍奉還1869年と、流れで覚えましょう。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 527.504,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b00.wav",
          "start": 527.504,
          "duration": 0.661,
          "text": "第二問!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b01.wav",
          "start": 528.465,
          "duration": 7.915,
          "text": "1872年、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b02.wav",
          "start": 536.68,
          "duration": 3.52,
          "text": "身分に関係なく子どもが学校へ通うことになった制度は何でしょう?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b03.wav",
          "start": 540.5,
          "duration": 1.845,
          "text": "ア、学制。イ、徴兵令。ウ、地租改正。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b04.wav",
          "start": 542.645,
          "duration": 2.069,
          "text": "みんなで学校へ…アなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b05.wav",
          "start": 545.015,
          "duration": 5.44,
          "text": "正解!学制です。義務教育の始まり、1872年とセットでどうぞ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 551.055,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b00.wav",
          "start": 551.055,
          "duration": 0.843,
          "text": "ラスト問題!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b01.wav",
          "start": 552.197,
          "duration": 8.757,
          "text": "1874年、板垣退助らが提出した建白書は何でしょう?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b02.wav",
          "start": 561.255,
          "duration": 5.653,
          "text": "ア、民選議院設立建白書。イ、大政奉還の建白書。ウ、開国の建白書。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b03.wav",
          "start": 567.208,
          "duration": 1.813,
          "text": "民の議会…アなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b04.wav",
          "start": 569.321,
          "duration": 5.536,
          "text": "正解!民選議院設立建白書です。自由民権運動の、出発点になります。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "section": "ending",
      "start": 575.657,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s20_b00.wav",
          "start": 575.657,
          "duration": 3.691,
          "text": "今日は明治の国づくり、大改革の数々を一気に見ました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s20_b01.wav",
          "start": 579.648,
          "duration": 6.421,
          "text": "廃藩置県、学制、徴兵令、地租改正、富岡製糸場、鹿鳴館…"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s20_b02.wav",
          "start": 586.369,
          "duration": 2.037,
          "text": "明治パワー、すごいのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s20_b03.wav",
          "start": 588.707,
          "duration": 1.963,
          "text": "次回ついに最終回の第10話!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s20_b04.wav",
          "start": 590.969,
          "duration": 3.957,
          "text": "二つの大戦と現代日本、明治の力が世界へ広がります!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s20_b05.wav",
          "start": 595.227,
          "duration": 3.755,
          "text": "ついにラストなのだ!チャンネル登録も、よろしくなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
